{
  "id": "NUM.31",
  "number": "31",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Numbers 31",
  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "31",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Punish the Midianites for what they did to the people of Israel. After you have done that, you will die.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses said to the people, “Get ready for war, so that you can attack Midian and punish them for what they did to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From each tribe of Israel send a thousand men to war.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So a thousand men were chosen from each tribe, a total of 12,000 men ready for battle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses sent them to war under the command of Phinehas son of Eleazar the priest, who took charge of the sacred objects and the trumpets for giving signals. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They attacked Midian, as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses, and killed all the men, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "including the five kings of Midian: Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur, and Reba. They also killed Balaam son of Beor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people of Israel captured the Midianite women and children, took their cattle and their flocks, plundered all their wealth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and burnt all their cities and camps. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They took all the loot that they had captured, including the prisoners and the animals, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and brought them to Moses and Eleazar and to the community of the people of Israel, who were at the camp on the plains of Moab across the Jordan from Jericho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses, Eleazar, and all the other leaders of the community went out of the camp to meet the army. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses was angry with the officers, the commanders of battalions and companies, who had returned from the war. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He asked them, “Why have you kept all the women alive? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5+NUM.25.6+NUM.25.7+NUM.25.8+NUM.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 25.1–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember that it was the women who followed Balaam's instructions and at Peor led the people to be unfaithful to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". That was what brought the epidemic on the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So now kill every boy and kill every woman who has had sexual intercourse, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but keep alive for yourselves all the girls and all the women who are virgins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now all of you who have killed anyone or have touched a corpse must stay outside the camp for seven days. On the third day and on the seventh day purify yourselves and the women you have captured. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You must also purify every piece of clothing and everything made of leather, goats' hair, or wood.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eleazar the priest said to the men who had returned from battle, “These are the regulations that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has given to Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Everything that will not burn, such as gold, silver, bronze, iron, tin, or lead, is to be purified by passing it through fire. Everything else is to be purified by the water for purification. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.22+NUM.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.22",
              "NUM.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the seventh day you must wash your clothes; then you will be ritually clean and will be permitted to enter the camp.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“You and Eleazar, together with the other leaders of the community, are to count everything that has been captured, including the prisoners and the animals. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Divide what was taken into two equal parts, one part for the soldiers and the other part for the rest of the community. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the part that belongs to the soldiers, withhold as a tax for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " one out of every 500 prisoners and the same proportion of the cattle, donkeys, sheep, and goats. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give them to Eleazar the priest as a special contribution to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the part given to the rest of the people, take one out of every fifty prisoners and the same proportion of the cattle, donkeys, sheep, and goats. Give them to the Levites who are in charge of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s Tent.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses and Eleazar did what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The following is a list of what was captured by the soldiers, in addition to what they kept for themselves: 675,000 sheep and goats, 72,000 cattle, 61,000 donkeys, and 32,000 virgins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.32+NUM.31.33+NUM.31.34+NUM.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.32",
              "NUM.31.33",
              "NUM.31.34",
              "NUM.31.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The half-share of the soldiers was 337,500 sheep and goats, of which 675 were the tax for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.36+NUM.31.37+NUM.31.38+NUM.31.39+NUM.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.36",
              "NUM.31.37",
              "NUM.31.38",
              "NUM.31.39",
              "NUM.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; 36,000 cattle for the soldiers, of which 72 were the tax for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.36+NUM.31.37+NUM.31.38+NUM.31.39+NUM.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.36",
              "NUM.31.37",
              "NUM.31.38",
              "NUM.31.39",
              "NUM.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; 30,500 donkeys for the soldiers, of which 61 were the tax for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.36+NUM.31.37+NUM.31.38+NUM.31.39+NUM.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.36",
              "NUM.31.37",
              "NUM.31.38",
              "NUM.31.39",
              "NUM.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; and 16,000 virgins for the soldiers, of which 32 were the tax for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.36+NUM.31.37+NUM.31.38+NUM.31.39+NUM.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.36",
              "NUM.31.37",
              "NUM.31.38",
              "NUM.31.39",
              "NUM.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.36+NUM.31.37+NUM.31.38+NUM.31.39+NUM.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.36",
              "NUM.31.37",
              "NUM.31.38",
              "NUM.31.39",
              "NUM.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses gave Eleazar the tax as a special contribution to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The share of the community was the same as that for the soldiers: 337,500 sheep and goats, 36,000 cattle, 30,500 donkeys, and 16,000 virgins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.42+NUM.31.43+NUM.31.44+NUM.31.45+NUM.31.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.42",
              "NUM.31.43",
              "NUM.31.44",
              "NUM.31.45",
              "NUM.31.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From this share Moses took one out of every fifty prisoners and animals, and as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded, gave them to the Levites who were in charge of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s Tent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the officers who had commanded the army went to Moses ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and reported, “Sir, we have counted the soldiers under our command and not one of them is missing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So we are bringing the gold ornaments, armlets, bracelets, rings, earrings, and necklaces that each of us has taken. We offer them to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " as a payment for our lives, so that he will protect us.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses and Eleazar received the gold, all of which was in the form of ornaments. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The total contribution of the officers weighed nearly 200 kilogrammes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who were not officers kept the loot they had taken. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses and Eleazar took the gold to the Tent, so that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " would protect the people of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
